  "description": {
   "en": "Chae Gyeong-jun, who gave up both college and his dreams due to the IMF crisis,\nonce again faces despair in front of his grandmother's sudden hospitalization fees.\nBut then, a \"Mysterious Benefactor\" steps in to cover the hospital costs for his family...\n\"Who would provide support that doesn't help them at all, and why?\"\nIn search of an answer, Gyeong-jun heads to Taeseong."
